<headline>FINAL PRICING - Chicago, Ill..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K Baum &amp; Co said it priced $70.405 million of Chicago, Ill., collateralized mortgage revenue bonds, series 1997A and 1997B, with a top yield of 6.33 percent in 2028.</p>
